00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:56.743
Derek Fisher, five time NBA

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:58.845
champion who's now serving as a

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:01.014
coach at Crespi Carmelite High

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.782
School here in the L.A. area,

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:03.349
before we do that, are there

00:03:03.416 --> 00:03:05.184
other members of the committee

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:07.020
