00:23:10.288 --> 00:23:12.390
And that's not necessarily what

00:23:12.457 --> 00:23:16.061
they do and what's not best for

00:23:16.128 --> 00:23:19.898
the system. And so, I just want

00:23:19.965 --> 00:23:22.033
