00:23:34.079 --> 00:23:35.914
and not just basketball, I

00:23:35.981 --> 00:23:36.448
played basketball, soccer,

00:23:36.515 --> 00:23:42.020
baseball, football throughout my

00:23:42.087 --> 00:23:42.621
