00:23:54.633 --> 00:23:56.201
allowed me to explore different

00:23:56.268 --> 00:23:58.236
sports, different things and

00:23:58.303 --> 00:24:00.372
find what was my path to

00:24:00.438 --> 00:24:04.009
accessing the best parts of who

00:24:04.075 --> 00:24:06.144
I could be. As a young boy, that

00:24:06.211 --> 00:24:06.678
loved basketball and loved

00:24:06.745 --> 00:24:10.048
sports and so, again, I just

00:24:10.115 --> 00:24:12.117
