00:33:14.826 --> 00:33:16.894
every day are playing for at

00:33:16.961 --> 00:33:19.030
least 60 minutes. You'll see the

00:33:19.097 --> 00:33:22.667
exact data on the next slide. We

00:33:22.734 --> 00:33:24.969
asked parents how often their

00:33:25.036 --> 00:33:26.738
young people for each child in

00:33:26.804 --> 00:33:28.606
their household was engaged in

00:33:28.673 --> 00:33:30.975
physical activity. The guideline

00:33:31.042 --> 00:33:32.677
is daily what we have in

00:33:32.744 --> 00:33:34.812
California is 3 in 5 youth.

00:33:34.879 --> 00:33:38.583
Nearly 66% are not engaged in

00:33:38.649 --> 00:33:40.618
physical activity daily, 34%

00:33:40.685 --> 00:33:44.822
are. We have 10%, roughly 1 in 1

00:33:44.889 --> 00:33:47.058
in nine who aren't engaged at

00:33:47.125 --> 00:33:50.628
all. Their parents say they

00:33:50.695 --> 00:33:52.764
never engage in any form of

00:33:52.830 --> 00:33:54.665
