01:26:45.867 --> 01:27:07.855
You.

01:27:57.872 --> 01:27:59.907
Angeles. And Renata, more than

01:27:59.974 --> 01:28:01.976
anybody here today is

01:28:02.043 --> 01:28:03.811
responsible for convening

01:28:03.878 --> 01:28:04.412
