01:28:12.086 --> 01:28:12.620
your way, the next panelist.

01:28:12.687 --> 01:28:16.024
Really impressive. Young man.

01:28:16.090 --> 01:28:16.591
He's the founder and CEO of

01:28:16.658 --> 01:28:19.894
sports for kids, he he is all of

01:28:19.961 --> 01:28:20.461
15 years old, making me feel

01:28:20.528 --> 01:28:22.196
