01:28:50.858 --> 01:28:52.326
Los Angeles Unified School

01:28:52.393 --> 01:28:54.128
District, principal, Ramirez is

01:28:54.195 --> 01:28:56.164
an advocate for holistic

01:28:56.230 --> 01:28:58.199
education. He emphasizes the

01:28:58.266 --> 01:28:58.866
