01:28:58.933 --> 01:29:00.134
with opportunities to develop

01:29:00.201 --> 01:29:02.170
both academic and character

01:29:02.236 --> 01:29:02.737
skills. He strongly believes

01:29:02.804 --> 01:29:05.907
that these skills are essential

01:29:05.973 --> 01:29:06.507
for shaping responsible global

01:29:06.574 --> 01:29:08.109
citizens who will make

01:29:08.176 --> 01:29:08.676
meaningful contributions to

01:29:08.743 --> 01:29:10.011
society and to their

01:29:10.078 --> 01:29:11.946
communities. And our next

01:29:12.013 --> 01:29:14.048
panelist, Doctor Hannah

01:29:14.115 --> 01:29:14.682
Thompson, if you could all come

01:29:14.749 --> 01:29:16.417
up as I introduce you, Doctor

01:29:16.484 --> 01:29:18.086
Thompson is an assistant

01:29:18.152 --> 01:29:19.954
research professor at the UC

01:29:20.021 --> 01:29:20.621
Berkeley School of Public Health

01:29:20.688 --> 01:29:22.123
with expertise in evaluating

01:29:22.190 --> 01:29:22.757
programs and policies related to

01:29:22.824 --> 01:29:24.325
physical activity, nutrition,

01:29:24.392 --> 01:29:26.260
and youth health. And Doctor

01:29:26.327 --> 01:29:28.329
Thompson, I would like to know,

01:29:28.396 --> 01:29:30.131
was also immensely helpful in

01:29:30.198 --> 01:29:32.066
the work I did last year with

01:29:32.133 --> 01:29:33.935
with my staff, in the successful

01:29:34.001 --> 01:29:36.104
passage of SB 291, which I

01:29:36.170 --> 01:29:38.072
mentioned earlier, which

01:29:38.139 --> 01:29:40.174
mandates a baseline standard of

01:29:40.241 --> 01:29:42.009
30 minutes of recess per day in

01:29:42.076 --> 01:29:42.610
California schools, and which

01:29:42.677 --> 01:29:44.045
also, importantly, prohibits the

01:29:44.112 --> 01:29:45.947
